<section class="section bg-canvas border-b-0 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px"
    style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(45,212,191,0.4), transparent);"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>
  <div
    class="absolute -bottom-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[480px] h-[480px] rounded-full pointer-events-none blur-[60px]"
    style="background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(45,212,191,0.06) 0%, rgba(45,212,191,0) 65%);"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <div class="shell relative">
   <div class="text-center max-w-[720px] mx-auto">
    <p class="eyebrow justify-center">GET STARTED · 시작</p>
    <p
      class="text-ink-strong font-normal tracking-tight m-0"
      style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.02em;"
    >
      바이브코딩의 시작은<br />
      <em class="not-italic text-primary-soft">‘탄탄한 기획’</em>입니다.
